{"id":"661583","name":"炒生瓜子","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661583/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"生瓜子","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"当季新货363，皮薄仁大。","img":"images/661583/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅烧温，啥也不放。","img":"images/661583/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒进瓜子。","img":"images/661583/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"翻翻。","img":"images/661583/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再翻翻。","img":"images/661583/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"继续翻翻。","img":"images/661583/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"皮上有些上色，可以了磕几个看看火候，这时候要翻的更勤啦，很容易炒糊，火调到最小。","img":"images/661583/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成熟就出锅，皮都均匀上色了。","img":"images/661583/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"瓜子有余温，还会再熟透一些，倒到大簸箕里，凉了又脆又香。","img":"images/661583/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}